e/131129.html)\n\n[![Image 64: Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/4/yellow-line-mumbai-metro-2A_300_450.jpg) Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B The Mumbai Metro Yellow line is segmented into two parts, i.e. line 2A and 2B. The Line 2B has recently become partially operational.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/yellow-line-metro-route-mumbai/130113.html)\n\n[![Image 65: Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/2/western-line-Mumbai_300_450.jpg) Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More The local train network of Mumbai is the heart of the city. In this vast network, Western Line Mumbai is one of the most important railway lines. This blog provides a deeper look into this railway line.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/western-line-mumbai/131117.html)\n\n[![Image 66: Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2026/8/FI-mumbai-vs-delhi-bengaluru_300_450.jpg) Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property? India's luxury housing market is set to nearly double by 2031 but not every city offers the same opportunity. Here's a real estate investment guide for HNIs in 2026 and why it matters.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/which-city-should-hnis-invest-in-luxury-property-jymb/151181.html)\n\n[![Image 67: Ready Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2021/1/rates%20CMS%203_300_450.jpg) Ready Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27 Ready reckoner in Mumbai is affected by the age and location of the property. Also, I know how to check the ready reckoner rate on the Maharashtra government website.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/ready-rekoner-rates-in-mumbai/118403.html)\n\n[![Image 68: Mumbai Ahmedabad